# [[.Name]] — step-by-step solution

```sh
astrona shell [[.Name]]
kubectl -n shop create deployment web --image=nginx:1.27-alpine --replicas=2
kubectl -n shop expose deployment web --port=80
kubectl -n shop get deploy,pods,svc
exit
astrona submit
```

`kubectl create deployment web` labels the pods `app=web`, which is what both the Service selector and the checks look for.
